            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Rose W"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This pie was so easy and delicious. I did have to change one thing and I used splenda brown sugar and used 1/2 of the 2/3 cup as recommended on the package and it was perfect! I'll never buy one again!",
            "datePublished": "2011-12-06T05:27:04.163Z"
          }
